        },
        "text_G7eEn9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Need candles that check every box—style, performance, and price? Kisco’s wholesale taper candles are ready to ship in bulk, giving you top-tier quality at scale. Our collection features a wide range of sizes and colors, allowing you to match any event theme or décor without compromise.</p><p>From intimate dinners to large-scale banquets, these candles offer a clean, classic look that elevates any space. Their dripless, smokeless design ensures no mess and no fuss, even during long events.</p><p>Ready to stock up? Our bulk taper candles come with built-in savings. The more you order, the more you save. Browse now and enjoy dependable quality with every pack.<br/><br/></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_4W4pwU",
        "border_7FLkyj",
        "text_G7eEn9"
