        },
        "border_pkLjkK": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_qC94zQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Planning a wedding? Running a fine dining restaurant? Managing retail inventory? When presentation matters, you need candles that deliver. Our bulk taper candles are a favorite among event planners, restaurants, and retail buyers for good reason. They burn clean, last long, and look great in any setting—from white-tablecloth dining rooms to product displays.</p><p>Taper candle bulk purchases eliminate the stress of last-minute shortages, keeping your inventory ready for whatever comes next. Whether you're planning a wedding or prepping for holiday traffic, you’ll always have candles that perform beautifully under pressure.</p><p>Keep things running smoothly. Choose our wholesale taper candles for bulk-ready brilliance you can trust. If you're seeking options in larger quantities, our wholesale taper candles provide the ideal solution for efficient sourcing.<br/><br/></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
