    "image_with_text_hDVA7h": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_ULNyji": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Why Buy Taper Candles in Bulk from Kisco Candles",
            "subheading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_FB7BVV": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_TyiDdW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Not all bulk taper candles are created equal. At <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Kisco Candles</span></a>, we’ve perfected the balance between high-quality craftsmanship and wholesale convenience. Our candles are made with plant-based wax and clean-burning cotton wicks, ensuring an elegant presentation and minimal residue. They're poured with precision, packaged for protection, and priced for savvy buyers who refuse to sacrifice style for cost.</p><p>We don’t just sell candles—we support businesses, planners, and creators who demand excellence. Our fast shipping, dedicated support, and exclusive wholesale pricing make us the go-to supplier for thousands of professionals nationwide.</p><p>Don’t settle for less. Make your bulk taper candle supplier one you can count on—Kisco Candles.<br/><br/></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
