    "image_with_text_jFC67D": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_mckbY9": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Perfect for Events and Businesses",
            "subheading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_i6tgzQ": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_hUYJ6B": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Kisco’s wholesale taper candles are built for more than just decoration—they’re a workhorse for events and businesses that can’t settle for second-best. Event planners know the chaos of last-minute surprises, and with these dripless, smokeless candles, there’s one less thing to worry about. Wedding pros count on their clean, steady glow to keep everything picture-perfect—especially when they need reliable <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/bulk-wedding-candles\" title=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/bulk-wedding-candles\">bulk wedding candles</a> that combine elegance with practicality. From elegant dining rooms to bustling banquet halls, these taper candles aren’t just functional—they’re a statement of quality your guests and clients will notice.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
