    "rich_text_ccb93b": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "spacer_atjF66": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 28
          }
        },
        "heading_RMqNcD": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Features That Make Our Taper Candles Stand Out",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "border_yzk8QB": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_BNfhHV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Kisco’s taper candles are more than just lighting—they’re an essential detail for anyone aiming to create a flawless experience. Carefully designed for performance and style, they offer the perfect balance of elegance and practicality, whether you’re planning an event or stocking up for your business.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_QAyyJJ": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 28
          }
        },
        "heading_chBx6Y": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Dripless and Smokeless Performance",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "spacer_YbKmgU": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "text_bergHm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Nobody wants wax running onto fine linens or smoky air clouding an event. Kisco’s <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/taper-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">taper candles</span></a> are engineered to burn cleanly and drip-free, even during extended use. They’re perfect for creating an elegant atmosphere without the hassle of messy wax cleanup or smoky interruptions, making them a must-have for high-profile events. For those in the trade, our wholesale taper candles ensure this performance at an unbeatable value.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_FHCCUt": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "heading_LciEqx": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Long-Lasting Burn Time",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "text_hVyHHc": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When the night runs long, so do our candles. Crafted to provide hours of steady, reliable light, these taper candles are built to outlast the demands of any gathering. Whether it’s a formal wedding or an intimate restaurant setting, their consistent burn means fewer replacements and more time enjoying the occasion.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_hGJ4gk": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "heading_WDgjBN": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Available in a Range of Colors and Sizes",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
