    "image_hero_gyLjgx": {
      "type": "image-hero",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_wBaypB": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Bulk Wholesale Taper Candles Made Easy with Kisco",
            "subheading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_y6Nnxf": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Ordering wholesale taper candles shouldn’t be complicated, and with Kisco, it’s not. Our user-friendly wholesale portal lets you stock up on dripless and smokeless bulk taper candles with ease. Whether you need taper candles for events, retail shelves, or hospitality settings, we offer competitive pricing and discounts for large orders. Trust Kisco to provide the quality and convenience your business or event demands, all in one seamless buying experience.</p>",
