    "custom_liquid_LHQnFy": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom_liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What sizes do your bulk taper candles come in?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"We offer bulk taper candles in several popular heights, including 4-inch, 5-inch, 6-inch, 7-inch, 10-inch, and 11.5-inch options. That range makes it easier to choose the right taper for low centerpieces, standard dining tables, or taller, more formal displays.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What colors are available for your bulk taper candles?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"White and ivory are the core colors in our bulk taper assortment, with red available in selected options. Most customers choose white or ivory for weddings, dinners, churches, and hospitality settings because those shades pair easily with classic décor and tableware.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How do I choose the right taper height for my event?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Shorter tapers are a good fit for smaller tables and lower floral arrangements, while taller tapers create a more formal look and add more vertical interest. If the table needs height and drama, a 10-inch or taller taper usually gives the strongest visual result.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Will your taper candles fit standard taper holders?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. Our taper candles are designed for standard taper holders, which makes them easy to use for weddings, restaurants, churches, and home entertaining. For the cleanest result, use a holder that supports the candle securely and keeps it upright.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How long do your taper candles burn?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Burn time depends on the taper size you choose. Shorter tapers are better for brief dinners or accent use, while longer tapers are a better fit for receptions, ceremonies, and events that need candlelight for a longer stretch.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Are your bulk taper candles a good choice for weddings?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. Taper candles are one of the best choices for wedding tables because they add height, elegance, and structure without crowding the centerpiece. They work especially well on reception tables, head tables, ceremony displays, and candelabras.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Are your taper candles made to burn cleanly?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. Our taper candles are made for clean, consistent performance when they are used upright in the correct holder and kept away from strong drafts. That makes them a dependable option for settings where presentation matters.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can I mix taper sizes or colors in one order?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. Many customers combine different packs to build a custom taper order for multiple rooms, table sizes, or event moments. That approach gives you more flexibility than relying on one uniform pack for the entire setup.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Do you offer large taper candle packs for venues or repeat-use buyers?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. We offer bulk packs that work well for venues, churches, restaurants, and planners who need a higher candle count. Larger packs are especially useful when the same taper style will be used across many tables or events.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Who usually buys bulk taper candles from Kisco Candles?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Our bulk taper candles are a strong fit for planners, venues, churches, restaurants, hospitality teams, and customers preparing for formal events. They are especially useful in spaces where the candle needs to look refined and consistent across a larger setup.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>",
        "divider_style": "none",
        "section_padding": "section--vertical-padding-top-bottom"
      }
    },
    "rich_text_p7D8ce": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "spacer_L8mYri": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "heading_MrGjAB": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Frequently Asked Questions about Wholesale Taper Candles",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "border_JMAjFR": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_phgQQw": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Get quick answers to common questions about Kisco’s wholesale taper candles, so you can make the best decision for your business or event.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_6THxWy": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_jRWLhL": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "What sizes do your bulk taper candles come in?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_cVFhCr": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We offer bulk taper candles in several popular heights, including 4-inch, 5-inch, 6-inch, 7-inch, 10-inch, and 11.5-inch options. That range makes it easier to choose the right taper for low centerpieces, standard dining tables, or taller, more formal displays.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_ykeVbb": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_fVaWkq": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "What colors are available for your bulk taper candles?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_xVMDY7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>White and ivory are the core colors in our bulk taper assortment, with red available in selected options. Most customers choose white or ivory for weddings, dinners, churches, and hospitality settings because those shades pair easily with classic décor and tableware.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_68L9WH": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_63Jihh": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "How do I choose the right taper height for my event?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_dttHE3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Shorter tapers are a good fit for smaller tables and lower floral arrangements, while taller tapers create a more formal look and add more vertical interest. If the table needs height and drama, a 10-inch or taller taper usually gives the strongest visual result.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_zbiA3h": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_YnWqLz": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Will your taper candles fit standard taper holders?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_HcQMNY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. Our taper candles are designed for standard taper holders, which makes them easy to use for weddings, restaurants, churches, and home entertaining. For the cleanest result, use a holder that supports the candle securely and keeps it upright.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_VhwRLY": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_qbbtEG": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "How long do your taper candles burn?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_zAcddy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Burn time depends on the taper size you choose. Shorter tapers are better for brief dinners or accent use, while longer tapers are a better fit for receptions, ceremonies, and events that need candlelight for a longer stretch.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_MkeeqJ": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_AAY3wR": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Are your bulk taper candles a good choice for weddings?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_VNBGfg": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. Taper candles are one of the best choices for wedding tables because they add height, elegance, and structure without crowding the centerpiece. They work especially well on reception tables, head tables, ceremony displays, and candelabras.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_mUzyyp": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_MGKnE3": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Are your taper candles made to burn cleanly?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_GPiEVA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. Our taper candles are made for clean, consistent performance when they are used upright in the correct holder and kept away from strong drafts. That makes them a dependable option for settings where presentation matters.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_7QXgMW": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "subheading_EFMKrR": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Can I mix taper sizes or colors in one order?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_dFpKT9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. Many customers combine different packs to build a custom taper order for multiple rooms, table sizes, or event moments. That approach gives you more flexibility than relying on one uniform pack for the entire setup.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_cKRBUQ": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "subheading_zNWEEc": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Do you offer large taper candle packs for venues or repeat-use buyers?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_mmGDwR": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. We offer bulk packs that work well for venues, churches, restaurants, and planners who need a higher candle count. Larger packs are especially useful when the same taper style will be used across many tables or events.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_X6Bxkw": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "subheading_tmDnLa": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Who usually buys bulk taper candles from Kisco Candles?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_qUBwj6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our bulk taper candles are a strong fit for planners, venues, churches, restaurants, hospitality teams, and customers preparing for formal events. They are especially useful in spaces where the candle needs to look refined and consistent across a larger setup.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
